.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt EVQ_WAIT 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm evq_wait
.Nd wait for registered sources
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn evq_wait evq out max timeout_ns
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm writes up to
.Fa max
records of `{ cookie: u64, events: u32, _pad: u32 }` and returns their count.
Zero timeout means wait indefinitely; an elapsed timeout returns zero.  Only
one thread may block in a particular queue at a time.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EBUSY
Another thread is waiting on this queue.
.It Er EFAULT
.Fa out is not writable user memory.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
